x541 text "u32 is a 32-bit unsigned integer. Arithmetic wraps modulo 2^32 in the default profile. bool is true or false. Arrays u32xN and records (T,T,...) are values: set and put return updated values without changing the original. io is a linear token; each io value must be used exactly once so the checker can track output order."
